WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.051
Democracy is not really out 
there in the world&nbsp;as a thing.

00:00:04.051 --> 00:00:08.221
Democracy, if it exists at all, 
exists inside us.

00:00:08.221 --> 00:00:12.254
Democracy has to begin with a&nbsp;
desire for the people to rule,

00:00:12.254 --> 00:00:14.867
which of course, is what 
democracy is all about.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:19.427
So I tend&nbsp;to think that in a way it's 
more useful to think of democracy

00:00:19.427 --> 00:00:22.121
as a verb rather than as a&nbsp;noun.

00:00:22.121 --> 00:00:23.995
I realize grammatically that's incorrect,

00:00:23.995 --> 00:00:26.792
but I think you understand 
the spirit of what&nbsp;I mean,

00:00:26.792 --> 00:00:29.533
that democracy is something that you do.

00:00:29.533 --> 00:00:31.364
It's something that, when you speak the&nbsp;word,

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:33.480
you have to be taking responsibility.

